<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EST" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Esta</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esta</para>
  <para style="toc3">Est</para>
  <para style="mt1">ESTA</para>
  <para style="is">ICHILONGOLE</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu achino cha Esta chotulongela mbuli tsa Wayahudi iwaghoghighwe na kughalighwa ako Perisia, apfila pfawakomboke na iwanu iwabamile kuwakoma. Hata ka litaghwa lya Imulungu ng'alyandikighwe baye mna ichitabu cha Esta, lekeni yomanyika ghendo ka Imulungu yuyo iyawakombole waleke kukomighwa wose. Kuduhu munu iyomanya nani iyandike ichitabu achino. Kwa ukululola ichiheburania chandikighwe mna ichitabu achino, iwanu wengi iwasomile wolonga ghendo ka ichitabu achino chandikighwa mna imiyaka ya 400 ng'ana Yesu yoneke.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aghala ighandikighwe mna ichitabu cha Esta ghotulongela apfila Wayahudi pfawadeng'elele ichihungo cha Purimu. Munu yumwe kulawa Ameleki iyakemighwe Hamani tsakabama ukuwakoma Wayahudi. Waisiraeli na Waamaleki wang'ali weihila kulawa ahala Waisiraeli hawabitile mna lijangwa kughenda kuna isi aila Imulungu iyelaghane nawo ka katsoweng'a (Kulawa 17.8-16). Matsuwa ghagho Hamani hayabamile kuwakoma Wayahudi, Esta, iyakalile Myahudi tsakawa malikia wa Pesia. Kwa kumhulikitsa ndughu yake Modekai Esta kapfulaghitsa achila Hamani chayabamile kutenda, Wayahudi hawawatowile maaduwi tsawo (Esta 9.20-22), Modekai kawalongela wadeng'elele kwa ukuhuma. Apfi pfipfo Wayahudi pfawanzile kudeng'elela ichihungo cha Purim.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mna ichitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 1 mbaka ya 2 tsotulangusa Esta pfayawile malikiya wa Pesia.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 3 mbaka ya 7 tsotulangusa apfila Hamani pfayabamile kuwakoma Wayahudi na apfila pfayakomighwe imwenyegho kwa ukutenda alino.</para>
  <para style="io">Isula ya 8 mbaka ya 10 tsolangusa Wayahudi pfawawatowile maaduwi tsawo na pfawanzile kudeng'elela ichihungo cha Purimu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EST 1" />
  <para style="s">Malikia Vashiti kolema laghitso lya Mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 1:1" />Aghano ghagho ighalawile mna ghamatsuwa ghayatawale mfalume Ahasuero, tsakatawala mikowa miya imwe na ishilini na saba, kulawa India mbaka Esiopia. <verse eid="EST 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 1:2" />Tsakatawala imikowa ayo aku yeye mwenyegho yang'ali yokala mna ghumji ghwa Shushani. <verse eid="EST 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 1:3" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kadatu ghwa utawala wake, mfalume Ahasuero kawatendela chihungo pfilongotsi na watenda sang'ano wake. Kawakema wakulu wa maasikali kulawa kuna imiji ya Perisia na Media, iwana wa chifalume na iwakulu wa imiji. <verse eid="EST 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 1:4" />Kwa miyetsi sita mfalume Ahasuero yang'ali yolangusa tsimali tsa ufalume wake unoghile, ukunogha kwa ipfinu pfake na utawala wake.<verse eid="EST 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 1:5" />Ghamatsuwa agho haghamalile, mfalume kawatendela chihungo iwanu wose wa ghumji ghwa Shushani, iwabala kwa iwadodo. Ichihungo acho tsachikala kwa matsuwa saba, chitendeka kuna iluwa lwa ibostani ya ing'anda ya mfalume. <verse eid="EST 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 1:6" />Hanu aho tsahahambighwa kwa mapanziya gha ihamba nzelu na buluu. Ghamapanziya agho tsaghohighwa kwa pfinanikilo pfa fetsa kwa mitsabi ya chitani chinoghile cha langi ya nzambalao, na ghakondekighwa mna tsingutso tsikighwe ghamabwe ghana ilangi. Ipfighoda pfa nzahabu na fetsa pfikighwa hasi hana ghamabwe ghana ilangi, mabwe gha bei ng'ulu gha langi ndung'u, nzelu, njano na nitu. <verse eid="EST 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 1:7" />Iwanu wanwa idipfai ikighwe mna pfikombe pfa nzahabu, chila chikombe ng'achighalile na chiyaghe baye, naye mfalume kwa uluso wake kaweng'a idipfai ya chifalume. <verse eid="EST 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 1:8" />Chila munu kanwa ka apfila pfayabamile, kwaapfila mfalume tsakawalaghitsa iwang'ali womsang'anila mna ing'anda yake ya chifalume, wamwing'e chila munu ka pfayobama.<verse eid="EST 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 1:9" />Matsuwa ghagho, malikia, ipinga wa mfalume iyakemighwe Vashiti kawatendela chihungo mapinga wayaghe mghati mwa ing'anda ya chifalume ya mfalume Ahasuero. <verse eid="EST 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 1:10" />Mna litsuwa lya saba lya ichihungo acho, mfalume Ahasuero aku kasangalamka sideke kwa idipfai iyanwele, kawakema tsina Mehumani, Bizita, Habona, Bighisa, Abasa, Setali na Karikasi, iwanu awala saba iwamsang'anile yeye imwenyegho. <verse eid="EST 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 1:11" />Kawalaghitsa wamghalile Vashiti, imalikia, aku kapfala litaji lyake lya chimalikia. Mfalume tsakabama yawalanguse iwanu na pfilongotsi apfila mwehe wake pfayanoghile, kwaapfila tsakanogha ng'ani. <verse eid="EST 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 1:12" />Lekeni iwanu iwamsang'anile mfalume hawamlongele chayalaghitse mfalume, Malikia Vashiti kalema ukughenda. Ichinu acho chimtenda mfalume yone maya na yaghudubuke ng'ani.<verse eid="EST 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 1:13" />Kwaapfila mfalume tsakana chihendo cha ukuwaghutsa iwanu wana ihekima, apfo kawakema iwanu iwamanyile ghamalaghitso na ukuhigha wamlongele cha ukutenda. <verse eid="EST 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 1:14" />Iwanu wake wa habehi iwang'ali womlongelagha cha ukutenda wawo awano, Karishena, Shetari, Adimata, Tarishishi, Maresi, Marisena na Memukani, awo tsawakala pfilongotsi saba iwolawa Perisia na Media iwakalilile wakulu ghendo mna ufalume wake. <verse eid="EST 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 1:15" />Naye kawaghusa apfino, “Kwa ukuwinza ghamalaghitso malikia Vashiti tumtendetse? Kwaapfila tsaniwatuma watumighwa wangu kuna yeye, lekeni kalema ukutoghola lilaghitso lyangu nene mfalume Ahasuero!”<verse eid="EST 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 1:16" />Baho Memukani kedika hambele ha mfalume na iwakulu, “Malikia Vashiti katotsa ghendo, si kwa mfalume yaliyeka baye, pfipfila katotsa hambele ha iwakulu wose, na iwanu wose iwali mna imikowa ya mfalume Ahasuero. <verse eid="EST 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 1:17" />Ichinu achino chayatendile malikia Vashiti hachitsomanyika kwa wapinga wose, wawo nawo watsowabetsa iwamale wawo, kuya watsolonga, ‘Mfalume Ahasuero kalaghitsa malikia Vashiti yaghalighwe hambele hake, lekeni yeye tsakalema.’ <verse eid="EST 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 1:18" />Leloli aino, wapinga wa iwakulu wa Perisia na Media iwahulike ghayatendile malikia Vashiti, watsowalongela pfipfo iwakulu wako, apfo watsowabetsa iwamale wawo, na iwamale watsowonela maya wapinga wawo. <verse eid="EST 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 1:19" />Lelo ghwe mfalume, ung'ona pfinogha, ulaghitse Vashiti yaleke kutsa keli hambele hako, lilaghitso alyo lyandikighwe mna ghamalaghitso gha Perisia na Media, ili lileke kughalambuka. Kuya umalikia wake yeng'ighwe pinga yungi yana ghamahala kubita yeye. <verse eid="EST 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 1:20" />Apfo lilaghitso alino lya mfalume halitsolongighwa chila hanu ha ufalume wako iuli mkulu, mapinga wose watsowategheletsa iwamale wawo, yawe mkulu au mdodo.”<verse eid="EST 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 1:21" />Ichinu acho chimnoghela ghendo mfalume na iwakulu wake, naye katenda ka pfayalongile Memukani. <verse eid="EST 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 1:22" />Apfo mfalume kaghala baluwa chila hanu hayatawale, chila mkowa na chila kabila kwa chilugha chawo na ka pfawakwandika, kulonga, chila mmale yawe mkulu wa ikaye yake, na chayolonga chiwe chicho.<verse eid="EST 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EST 2" />
  <para style="s">Esta kosaghulighwa yawe malikia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 2:1" />Hambele, imaya ya mfalume haimalile, mfalume kamkumbuka Vashiti, na achila chayatendile na achila chayalaghitse yatendelighwe. <verse eid="EST 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 2:2" />Apfo iwatumighwa wake iwang'ali womsang'anila yeye imwenyegho, wamlongela, “Leka ubamilighwe iwali iwanoghile, awala ng'ana wawase na mmale baye. <verse eid="EST 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 2:3" />Kodaha kusaghula wakulu mna chila mkowa ghwautawala, uwalaghitse wawaghale iwali wose iwanoghile mna ing'anda ya iwapinga ahano hana ghumji ghwa Shushani. Kuya walolesighwe na Hegai, mtumighwa yumswayule yawakalitse wapinga, kuko weng'ighwe mapfuta na pfinu pfingi wadahe kwihamba ghendo. <verse eid="EST 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 2:4" />Imwali iyatsokunoghela ng'ani yawe malikia, yasole hanu ha Vashiti.” Mfalume kona pfinogha, apfo katenda pfipfo.<verse eid="EST 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 2:5" />Mna ghumji ghwa Shushani tsakuna munu yumwe Myahudi wa likabila lya Benjamini, taghwa lyake Modekai. Modekai tsamwana wa Yairi, Yairi tsa mwana wa Shimei, naye Shimei tsa mwana wa Kishi. <verse eid="EST 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 2:6" />Modekai tsa yumwe wa iwanu iwaghalighwe kuna isi ya utumwa ako Babeli, kulawa Yerusalemu ahala mfalume Yekoniya wa Yuda hayaghoghighwe na Nebukadineza mfalume wa Babeli. <verse eid="EST 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 2:7" />Modekai tsakana mwihwaghe iyakemighwe Esta, kwa Chiebulaniya imwali ayo tsakakemighwa Hadasa. Esta tsakanogha kwa ilukuli na ichihanga. Iwamweleke hawafile, Modekai kamsola, kamlela ka mwanaghe. <verse eid="EST 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 2:8" />Laghitso lya mfalume halitangatsighwe, iwali wose waghalighwa kuna ghumji mkulu ghwa Shushani, wekighwa walolesighwe na Hagai. Esta naye tsakaghalighwa kuna ing'anda ya mfalume, yalolesighwe na Hagai, iyang'ali yowakalitsa wamapinga. <verse eid="EST 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 2:9" />Hegai tsakanoghelwa na Esta, mbaka yang'ali yomtendela uluso Esta. Baho Hegai kamwing'a Esta ghamapfuta na ichijo chinoghile. Kuya kamwika hanu hanoghile ghendo mna ing'anda ayo ya wamapinga, kamsaghulila watumwa saba mapinga kulawa kuna ing'anda ya mfalume wamsang'anile.<verse eid="EST 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 2:10" />Esta tsang'ana yalonge baye yolawila lukolo lwachi wala kabila lyachi, kwaapfila Modekai tsakamghoma yaleke ukutenda apfo. <verse eid="EST 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 2:11" />Chila tsuwa Modekai tsayang'ali yobita hambele ha iluwa lwa ing'anda ayo ya wamapinga ili yamanye Esta pfayoghendelela na aghala ighang'ali ghomlawila.<verse eid="EST 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 2:12" />Ichipindi cha ukwihamba iwali tsa mwaka ghumwe, miyetsi sita ya mwanduso tsawabakala ghamafuta gha manemane, na miyetsi sita ya ukumalitsila tsawabakala mapfuta ighonung'ila ghoya na ghamapfuta ghangi. Haghamalile ghamatsuwa agho, chila mwali tsakaghalighwa yaliyeka kwa mfalume Ahasuero. <verse eid="EST 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 2:13" />Hawang'ali woghenda kwa mfalume, chila mwali tsakeng'ighwa chinu chayabamile kusola kulawa mna ing'anda ya wamapinga yaghende nacho kuna ing'anda ya mfalume. <verse eid="EST 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 2:14" />Imwali koghenda nemihe na nemitondo kakuya kuna ing'anda ingi ya mapinga, aku kololesighwa na Shaashigazi, iyang'ali iyowakalitsa mapinga wangi wa mfalume. Imwali ng'odaha ukuya keli kwa mfalume, mbaka yamnoghele mfalume na yalaghitse yakemighwe taghwa lyake.<verse eid="EST 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 2:15" />Chipindi chipfika cha Esta ukughenda mna ing'anda ya mfalume. Ayo tsa neghe Abihaili, mtumba wake Modekai, iyamlelile ka mwanaghe, yeye ng'alombile chinu chochose baye kubita achila chayalongile Hegai yapfale, imtumighwa iyowalolesa mapinga wa mfalume. Chila munu iyamwonile Esta tsakanoghelwa naye. <verse eid="EST 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 2:16" />Apfo Esta kaghalighwa mna ing'anda ya mfalume haghupfikile mwaka ghwa saba ghwayatawale mfalume Ahasuero, ghumwetsi ghwa kumi ighukemighwa Tebeti. <verse eid="EST 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 2:17" />Mfalume kanoghelighwa na Esta kubita pfayanoghelighwe na iwapinga wose. Tsakamkunda ng'ani kubita wali wangi. Apfo mfalume kampfatsa litaji lya malikia mwitwi, kamtenda yawe malikia yasole hanu ha Vashiti. <verse eid="EST 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 2:18" />Kuya mfalume kamtendela Esta chihungo chikulu, kawakema pfilongotsi na iwatumwa wose wa ufalume wake. Kuya mfalume kawaleka iwanu wabwihile mna imikowa yose, na kawaghweka iwanu pfinu bwelele pfa chifalume.<verse eid="EST 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Modekai komkombola mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 2:19" />Iwali hawetingane lwa keli, Modekai ttsakasaghulighwa yawe yumwe wa iwakulu. <verse eid="EST 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 2:20" />Esta tsang'ana yawalongele baye iwanu ka yeye yolawa kabila lyachi na lukolo lwachi. Tsakatenda ka Modekai pfayamlaghitse kwaapfila Esta tsayang'ali yomhulikitsa Modekai ka pfipfila pfayang'ali yomhulikitsa hayang'ali yomlela. <verse eid="EST 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 2:21" />Modekai hayang'ali yokalagha hana lilango lya mfalume, Bigitana na Tereshi, wakulu weli wa mfalume iwakalitse lilango lya mfalume, wamwonela maya mfalume Ahasuero mbaka wabama kumkoma. <verse eid="EST 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 2:22" />Modekai tsakamanya chinu acho chihile, kamlongela malikia Esta, naye Esta kamlongela mfalume. <verse eid="EST 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 2:23" />Hawaipelembe imbuli ayo, yoneka yolongesa, apfo iwanu awo weli wakondekighwa mna imibiki ya ukukomela. Na imbuli ayo yandikighwa mna ichitabu ichikwandikighwa tsimbuli tsa mfalume.<verse eid="EST 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EST 3" />
  <para style="s">Hamani kobama ukuwakoma Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 3:1" />Haghamalile agho, mfalume Ahasuero kamwongetsa ukulu Hamani, mwana wa Hamedata, iyolawa mna ilukolo lwa Agagi. Kamtenda yawe mkulu kubita wakulu wamwenga wose. <verse eid="EST 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 3:2" />Iwakulu wose wa mfalume iwakalile hana lilango lya mfalume tsawamtowela magoti na kumwinamila, kwaapfila mfalume kalaghitsa Hamani yatendelighwe pfipfo. Lekeni yeye ng'amtowele Modekai magoti baye wala ng'amwinamile baye. <verse eid="EST 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 3:3" />Iwakulu wangi iwakalile hana lilango lya mfalume wamghutsa Modekai, “Hebali ghweghwe koghabetsa malaghitso gha mfalume?” <verse eid="EST 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 3:4" />Chila tsuwa wang'ali womlongela yaleke ukutenda apfo, lekeni Modekai ng'awahulikitse baye. Apfo wamlongela Hamani imbuli ayo ili yone ka kodaha kududumila ghayotenda Modekai, kwaapfila tsakawalongela ka yeye tsamyahudi. <verse eid="EST 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 3:5" />Hamani hayonile Modekai ng'omtowela magoti baye wala ng'amwinamile baye, kona maya ghendo. <verse eid="EST 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 3:6" />Kuya hayamanyile ka Modekai kamyahudi, kona ng'apfinoghile baye yamkome yaliyeka. Apfo katenda tsengwe yawakome Wayahudi wose, iwali mna ufalume wa Ahasuero.<verse eid="EST 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 3:7" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na mbili ghwayatawale mfalume Ahasuero, mna ghumwetsi ghwa mwanduso ighukemighwa Nisani, Hamani kalaghitsa iwanu wase tsisimbi walamle wapate litsuwa na ghumwetsi ghwayatsotenda litsengwe lyake. Apfo isimbi ighwila mna litsuwa lya kumi na nne lya ghumwetsi ghwa kumi na mbili ighukemighwa Adari.<verse eid="EST 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 3:8" />Kuya Hamani kamlongela mfalume, “Hana wanu wa isi imwe mna imikowa yose ya utawala wako, iwanu awo wana malaghitso ghangi, nagho ing'agheghala baye na malaghitso gha iwanu wangi. Pfipfila wawo ng'awoghakinda baye ghamalaghitso ghako, apfo nakona mfalume uleke kuwadudumila. <verse eid="EST 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 3:9" />Ka kwakona pfinogha, ulaghitse iwanu awano wakomighwe. Na nene nitsakwika fetsa kilo elufu salasini na saba na miya tano mna ihatsina ya mfalume, iwalihe iwanu iwatsotenda ing'onde aino.”<verse eid="EST 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 3:10" />Apfo mfalume kaitsula ipete yake ya ukwikila ghumuhuli, kamwing'a aduwi wa Wayahudi Hamani mwana Hamedata iyolawa mna ilukolo lwa Agagi. <verse eid="EST 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 3:11" />Baho mfalume kamlongela Hamani, “Kwing'ighwa iwanu wose na tsifetsa atso, utumile ka pfaubama.”<verse eid="EST 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 3:12" />Apfo litsuwa lya kumi na tatu lya ghumwetsi ghwa mwanduso, Hamani kawakema pfilongotsi wose wa mfalume, kaweng'a usenga ubamighwa wandikighwe kwa chila lugha na chila pfawakwandika iwanu mna ufalume awo, kuya ughalighwe kwa watawala wose wa mfalume, wakulu wa mikowa yose, wakulu wa makabila ghose na chila mkowa kwa chilugha chawo. Tsibaluwa atso tsandikighwa kwa taghwa lya mfalume Ahasuero na kughelighwa muhuli ghwa ipete yake. <verse eid="EST 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 3:13" />Iwasenga waghala tsibaluwa atso kuna chila mkowa, ghwa ufalume awo. Tsibaluwa atso tsilonga, Wayahudi wose, iwasongolo, na iwabala na wamapinga na iwana, wose wobamighwa wakomighwe na wahupe ghendo, na ipfinu pfawo pfose pfisolighwe mna litsuwa limwe liliyeka, litsuwa lya kumi na tatu lya ghumwetsi ghwa kumi na mbili ighukemighwa Adari. <verse eid="EST 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 3:14" />Ibaluwa ayo tsaibamighwa isomighwe mwatsi ghendo mna chila mkowa ili iwanu wose wesafulule kwa litsuwa alyo. <verse eid="EST 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 3:15" />Lilaghitso alino lilapfighwa mna ghumji ghwa Shushani ka mfalume pfayalaghitse. Iwasenga nawo tsawatangatsa chila hanu. Mfalume na Hamani tsawakala hasi wakunwa, lekeni iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Shushani wang'ali woghanzika.<verse eid="EST 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EST 4" />
  <para style="s">Modekai komlomba Esta yamwapfile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 4:1" />Modekai hayamanyile ghose ighalawile, kadegha ghamagwanda ghake, kapfala maghunila na kebakatsa lipfu. Kuya kabita mghati mwa ghumji aku kolila na kodamilila kwa usungu. <verse eid="EST 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 4:2" />Kaghenda mbaka hana lilango lya ing'anda ya mfalume, lekeni ng'adahile ukwingila baye kwaapfila tsakuduhu munu iyodaha kwingila mna ing'anda ya mfalume aku kapfala maghunila. <verse eid="EST 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 4:3" />Chila mkowa laghitso lya mfalume halitangatsighwe kukala na chililo chikulu mghati mwa Wayahudi. Wafunga ukuja, walila na ukudomboketsa, na wanu wengi mna wawo wawasa mlipfu aku wapfala maghunila. <verse eid="EST 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 4:4" />Malikiya Esta hayalongelighwe na iwatumwa wake mapinga, na iwatumwa wake iwamale iwaswayulighwe tsimbuli tsa Modekai, kona usungu sideke. Kamghalila magwanda yapfale, yaleke kupfala ghamaghunila, lekeni Modekai kaghalema. <verse eid="EST 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 4:5" />Apfo Esta kamkema Hataki, yumwe wa iwanu wa mfalume iyawaswayule na iyamsaghule mfalume yamsang'anile malikiya, kamtuma kwa Modekai yamghutse hebali yotenda apfo. <verse eid="EST 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 4:6" />Kuya Hataki kamghendela Modekai hachibwalu, hambele ha lilango lya ing'anda ya mfalume. <verse eid="EST 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 4:7" />Naye Modekai kampetela Hataki ghose ighalawile, na isendi yose Hamani iyelaghane ukuliha mna ihatsina ya mfalume kwa ukuwakoma Wayahudi wose. <verse eid="EST 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 4:8" />Kuya kamwing'a ibaluwa ya litangatso ililapfighwe mna ghumji ghwa Shushani kwa imbuli ya ukukomighwa kwa Wayahudi, kamlomba yamghalile Esta na yamlongele agho ghose, na kumlongela yaghende yakamdedetse mfalume na yamlombe yawonele libatsi Wayahudi, iwanu wake Esta. <verse eid="EST 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 4:9" />Apfo Hataki kaghenda kamlongela Esta ghose ghayalongile Modekai, <verse eid="EST 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 4:10" />naye Esta kamlongela Hataki yoye yamlongele Modekai, <verse eid="EST 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 4:11" />“Iwakulu wose wa mfalume na iwanu wose wa imikowa womanya ghendo ka imunu wowose, yawe mmale au pinga yang'engila mna iluwa lwa mghati na kumwona mfalume bila ukukemighwa, imunu ayo yakomighwe. Imunu iyodaha kuhona ayula mfalume iyatsomlotsela ing'weku yake ya chifalume ya nzahabu ili yamuhonetse. Na nene kwa mwetsi mgima sina nikemighwe baye na mfalume.”<verse eid="EST 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 4:12" />Modekai hayahulike chayalongile Esta, <verse eid="EST 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 4:13" />kamwidika, kalonga, kamlongele apfino Esta, “Uleke kughamba kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa mna ing'anda ya mfalume kutsokala mgima kubita Wayahudi wose. <verse eid="EST 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 4:14" />Ung'enyamala tulu mna ichipindi ka achino, Wayahudi watsakwapfilighwa kulawa hanu hangi, nawo watsokombolighwa, lekeni ghweghwe kutsakufa, na iwanu wa aba wako watsokomighwa. Angu nani iyomanya songaha kutendighwa malikia mna ichipindi ka achino?”<verse eid="EST 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 4:15" />Kuya Esta katuma wanu wakamlongele Modekai apfino, <verse eid="EST 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 4:16" />“Ughende uketingane hamwe na Wayahudi iwokala Shushani. Mfunge ukuja na ukunwa kwa matsuwa madatu, chilo na misi kwaajili yangu. Na nene na iwatumwa wangu mapinga tutsotenda pfipfo. Kuya nitsomghendela mfalume, hata ka malaghitso ghoghoma ukutenda apfo. Ka ukufa, leka nife.”<verse eid="EST 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 4:17" />Apfo Modekai koka, katenda ka Esta pfayamlongele.<verse eid="EST 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EST 5" />
  <para style="s">Esta kowalika mfalume na Hamani kuna ichijo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 5:1" />Tsuwa lya kadatu kulawa hayanzile ukufunga, Esta kapfala ghamaghwanda ghake gha chimalikia, kaghenda kwima hana ichibwalu chili mghati mwa ing'anda ya mfalume, aku kololesa ichikuta cha mfalume. Mfalume tsakakala mng'anda, mna ichighoda chake cha ufalume, kololesa ghumlango ghwa ukwingilila mna ing'anda yake ya chifalume. <verse eid="EST 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 5:2" />Mfalume hayamwonile Esta kema hana iluwa, kanoghelighwa naye, kamlotsa na ing'weku yake ya nzahabu iyaikindile mmoko mwake. Esta kaghenda habehi kadonza kusa kwa ing'weku ayo. <verse eid="EST 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 5:3" />Kuya mfalume kamghutsa, “Ubama choni Esta? Nongele chaubama, naghwe kutsakwing'ighwa hata ka nusu ya ufalume wangu.”<verse eid="EST 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 5:4" />Esta kamwidika, “Ka kwakona pfinogha, ghwe mfalume wangu, leloli utse hamwe na Hamani kuna ichijo chanikwambikile ghweghwe mfalume.”<verse eid="EST 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 5:5" />Mfalume kalaghitsa imunu yakamkeme Hamani yatse himahima, ka pfayalombile Esta. Apfo mfalume na Hamani waghenda kuna ichijo chayawambikile Esta. <verse eid="EST 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 5:6" />Hawang'ali wakunwa idipfai, mfalume kamghutsa keli Esta, “Ubama choni? Nongele, naghwe kutsopata hata ka nusu ya ufalume wangu, kutsakwing'ighwa.”<verse eid="EST 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 5:7" />Esta kamwidika, “Ichinu chanibama achino, <verse eid="EST 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 5:8" />Ka kwakona pfinogha, ghwe mfalume wangu, utoghole, ghweghwe na Hamani ilupfi mtse kuna ichijo chanitsowambikila. Baho nitsokulongela chanibama.”<verse eid="EST 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamani kopanga ukumkoma Modekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 5:9" />Hamani kalawa kuna ichijo acho aku kodeng'elela na ghumoyo ghusangalamka. Lekeni hayamwonile Modekai hana lilango lya ing'anda ya mfalume, ng'emile baye wala ng'amdedemekele baye, Hamani kona maya ng'ani. <verse eid="EST 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 5:10" />Lekeni kadudumila kaghenda ukaye. Kuya kawakema ukaye yake sale tsake, na imwehe wake Zereshi. <verse eid="EST 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 5:11" />Baho kanza kwighoda apfila pfayali na tsimali nyingi, iwana wamale iyali nawo, na apfila mfalume pfayamwinule yawe mkulu kubita iwakulu wose wa mfalume. <verse eid="EST 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 5:12" />Hamani kaghendelela kwighoda, kalonga, “Nene niliyeka ghendo yuyo yanikemighwe na Esta nilongotse na mfalume kuna ichijo. Pfipfila katukema nene na mfalume tughende kuna ichihungo ilupfi. <verse eid="EST 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 5:13" />Lekeni aghano ghose ng'aghonenda baye nene nideng'e ka noghendelela kumwona Myahudi ayula Modekai hana lilango lya ing'anda ya mfalume.”<verse eid="EST 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 5:14" />Zereshi, imwehe wake na sale tsake wose wamlongela apfino, “Utengenetse mbiki ghuna utali wa futi sabini na tano, na ilupfi nemitondo ulonge na mfalume, Modekai yakomelighwe amwo, baho kutsakwingila na mfalume mna ichijo kwa ndeng'elo.” Imbuli ayo imnoghelesa Hamani, naye ketengenetsa ghumbiki ghwa ukukomela.<verse eid="EST 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EST 6" />
  <para style="s">Modekai kotunyighwa na mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 6:1" />Chilo achila mfalume kakala meso, apfo kalaghitsa ichitabu ichandikighwe ighalawile chila tsuwa ahala hayang'ali yotawala, kuya chisomighwa hambele hake. <verse eid="EST 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 6:2" />Yoneka yandikighwa mchitabu acho ka Modekai tsakatanga ka Bigitana na Tereshi, wakulu wabili wa mfalume iwakalitse lilango, tsawatenda tsengwe lya ukumkoma mfalume. <verse eid="EST 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 6:3" />Mfalume kaghutsa, “Angu Modekai tsatumwing'ile ukulu wachi na tumghwekile choni kwa ichinu achino?” Iwatumighwa wake wamwidika, “Ng'atendelighwe chinu chochose baye.” <verse eid="EST 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 6:4" />Mfalume kaghutsa, “Pfihi kuna mkulu wowose kuna ichikuta?” Baho Hamani kengila mna ichikuta cha kunze cha ing'anda ya mfalume. Tsakatsa kwa mfalume yalombe Modekai yakomighwe mna ghumbiki ghwa ukukomela ghwayaghutengenetse. <verse eid="EST 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 6:5" />Iwatumighwa wamwidika mfalume, “Hamani kabaha, kema mchikuta.” Mfalume kawalongela, “Mlongeleni yengile mng'anda.” <verse eid="EST 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 6:6" />Hamani hayengile mng'anda, mfalume kamghutsa, “Pfihi yatendelighwe choni imunu ayula mfalume iyobama yamtende yawe mkulu?” Hamani kafikitsa mmoyo mwake, “Angu imunu ayo mfalume iyobama kumwing'a ukulu nani? Ambe nene!” <verse eid="EST 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 6:7" />Apfo Hamani kamwidika mfalume, “Imunu ayo mfalume iyonoghelwa naye kumwing'a ukulu, <verse eid="EST 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 6:8" />pfinogha iwatumighwa wako waghale magwanda ghayapfalagha mfalume, na falasi iyamdinagha, iyapfatsighwe litaji lya chifalume mwitwi mwake. <verse eid="EST 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 6:9" />Yumwe wa iwatumighwa wako iyotegheletsighwa sideke, yampfatse imunu ayo magwanda ghako gha chifalume, kuya yamlongotse imunu ayo aku kadina ifalasi wako kubitila inzila ng'ulu ya ghumji, aku kolonga, ‘Apfi pfipfo pfayotendelighwa imunu ayula mfalume iyombama yamwing'e ukulu.’ ” <verse eid="EST 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 6:10" />Baho mfalume kamlaghitsa Hamani, “Tenda hima! Sola ghamagwanda agho na ifalasi, ukamtende Modekei yawe mkulu, Myahudi iyokala hana lilango lya ing'anda ya mfalume. Uleke kuleka kumtendela hata chinu chimwe mna agho ghaulongile.” <verse eid="EST 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 6:11" />Apfo Hamani kasola ghamagwanda agho na ifalasi, kampfatsa Modekai, kamdinitsa mchanya mwa ifalasi kamlongotsa mna inzila ng'ulu ya ghumji, akuno kolonga, “‘Apfi pfipfo pfayotendelighwa imunu ayula mfalume iyombama yamtende yawe mkulu.’” <verse eid="EST 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 6:12" />Kuya Modekai koya hana lilango lya ing'anda ya mfalume. Lekeni Hamani katsumila ukaye yake, aku kana usungu mkulu na keghubika litwi lyake kwa ichinyala. <verse eid="EST 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 6:13" />Ako ukaye kawapetela Zereshi mwehe wake, na sale tsake ghose ighamlawile. Zereshi na sale tsake awo wamlongela, “Ka ayuno Modekai, yuwanduse kumwinamila Myahudi, ghweghwe ng'umdaha baye, ayo katsokuhuma ghendo.”<verse eid="EST 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamani kokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 6:14" />Hawang'ali wolonga naye, watumighwa wa mfalume wasumka ukutsa, wamsola Hamani waghenda naye kuna ichijo chayambike Esta.<verse eid="EST 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EST 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 7:1" />Apfo mfalume na Hamani waghenda kwa malikiya Esta ukuja ichijo. <verse eid="EST 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 7:2" />Mna litsuwa lya kabili, hawang'ali wakunwa dipfai, mfalume kamghutsa keli Esta, “Angu ubama choni malikiya Esta? Nongele, naghwe kutsopata. Chaubama choni? Hata inusu ya ufalume wangu, kutsakwing'ighwa.” <verse eid="EST 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 7:3" />Malikia Esta kamwidika, “Ghwe mfalume, ka kwakona pfinogha, unendele chanilomba, nolomba nene nighenddele kukala mgima, na iwanu wangu nawo waghendelele kukala wagima. <verse eid="EST 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 7:4" />Kwaapfila nene na iwanu wangu tuutsighwa kwa iwanu wangi, nawo watsotuhinya, watsotukoma na kututenda tuhupe ghendo. Ka tung'autsighwe tuwe watumwa wamale na mapinga, nene ning'enyamale tulu, ning'alekile kutsa kukutsupfa mfalume kwa ukughanzika ako!”<verse eid="EST 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 7:5" />Baho mfalume Ahasuero kamghutsa malikiya Esta, “Angu nani ayo iyoghetsa ukutenda chinu ka acho? Yalikwani imunu ayo?” <verse eid="EST 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 7:6" />Malikiya Esta kamwidika, “Aduwi wetu mkulu na iyotudununza, yuyo Hamani!” Baho Hamani kandusa ukupfuka hambele ha mfalume na malikiya. <verse eid="EST 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 7:7" />Mfalume kenuka aku kana maya, kaileka idipfai yake, kaghenda kunze hana ibostani ya ing'anda yake ya chifalume. Hamani hayonile ka mfalume kobama kumhigha kasighala kuchughu yamlombe malikiya Esta yaukombole ugima wake. <verse eid="EST 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 7:8" />Kuya mfalume koya kulawa kuna ibostani, baho hayengile mna ichikuta hawang'ali wakunwa idipfai, kampfika Hamani keyasa habehi na ichighoda chayakalile Esta. Hayonile apfo, mfalume kalonga kwa litsi kulu, “Apfi imunu ayuno kobama yamghoghe kwa ngupfu malikiya hambele hangu? Kuya kotenda agho mng'anda mwa mfalume!” Baho mfalume ng'ana yamalitse ukulonga, iwatumighwa wamghubika Hamani uhanga. <verse eid="EST 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 7:9" />Haribona, yumwe wa iwatumighwa iwamsang'anile mfalume, kalonga, “Ghwe mfalume, Hamani katengenetsa mbiki ghwa kumkomela Modekai, munu iyaukombole ugima wako. Ghumbiki aghwo ghuna utali wa futi sabini na tano, ghwabaho hakaye yake.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:9">Baho mfalume kalaghitsa, “Mkondekeni mumo Hamani.” <verse eid="EST 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 7:10" />Naye Hamani kakondekighwa mumo mna ghumbiki ghwa ukukomela ghwayatengenetse yamkome Modekai. Na baho imaya ya mfalume itsigha.<verse eid="EST 7:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EST 8" />
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wakuyitsa aghala ghawatendelighwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 8:1" />Tsuwa lilyo, mfalume Ahasuero kamwing'a malikiya Esta mali tsose tsa Hamani, aduwi wa Wayahudi. Esta kamlongela mfalume ka Modekai tsandughu yake. Apfo kulawa litsuwa alyo, Modekai kalekelelighwa yamwone mfalume. <verse eid="EST 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 8:2" />Mfalume katsula ipete yake ya ghumuhuli iyambokile Hamani, kamwing'a Modekai. Naye malikiya Esta kamsaghula Modekai yemilile tsimali tsa Hamani.<verse eid="EST 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 8:3" />Kuya Esta kalonga keli na mfalume, keghwisa hasi, hana ghamaghulu gha mfalume, aku kolila, kamlomba mfalume yaghaghome aghala ighehile Hamani wa ilukolo lwa Agagi ghayabamile kuwatendela Wayahudi. <verse eid="EST 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 8:4" />Mfalume kamgholosela malikiya Esta ingw'eku yake ya nzahabu, naye Esta kenuka kema hambele hake, kalonga, <verse eid="EST 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 8:5" />“Ka kwakona pfinogha ghwe mfalume, naghwe ung'anitogholela, naghwe ka kwakona pfinogha ukutenda apfo, nokulomba wandike laghitso, ughaghome ighandikighwe mna tsibaluwa tsa Hamani mwana Hamedata, iyolawa mna ilukolo lwa Agagi, chayapangile yawakome Wayahudi wose mna imikowa yose. <verse eid="EST 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 8:6" />Kwaapfila nidahatse kududumila ukuwona iwanu wangu wohinyighwa? Na nidahatse kuwona iwanu wangu wokomighwa?”<verse eid="EST 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 8:7" />Mfalume Ahasuero kamwidika malikia Esta na Modekai, ayula Imyahudi, “Mlole, nimwing'a Esta tsimali tsa Hamani, naye ma wamkondeka kuna ghumbiki ghwa ukukomela, kwa litsengwe lyayawatendele Wayahudi. <verse eid="EST 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 8:8" />Mwodaha kuwandikila Wayahudi chinu chochose chambama. Kuya mwodaha kwandika kwa taghwa lyangu na kwika ghumhuli ghwa ipete ya mfalume, kwaapfila ibaluwa ililapfighwa kwa litaghwa lya mfalume na kwikighwa mhuli ghwa ipete ya mfalume, nayo ng'aidaha kughalusighwa baye.”<verse eid="EST 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 8:9" />Apfo mna litsuwa lya ishilini na tatu lya mwetsi ghwa kadatu ighukemighwa Siwani, Modekai kawakema makatibu wose wa mfalume, kawalaghitsa wandike baluwa kwa Wayahudi na kwa iwakulu, watawala na iwakulu wa imikowa yose miya imwe na ishilini na saba, kwanzila India mbaka Esiopia. Tsibaluwa atso tsandikighwa chila mkowa kwa lugha yawo na ka pfawandikagha, pfipfila na kwa Wayahudi. <verse eid="EST 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 8:10" />Modekai katsandika tsibaluwa atso kwa taghwa lya mfalume Ahasuero, katsika ghumuhuli ghwa ipete ya mfalume. Na iwatsighalile tsawakala watumighwa iwadinile falasi wana tsingupfu iwotsuma ng'ani.<verse eid="EST 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 8:11" />Kubitila tsibaluwa atso, mfalume kawalekelela Wayahudi mna chila mji wetingane hamwe ili weyamile ugima wawo. Tsawalekelighwa kuhinyighwa, ukukoma bila kulyonela libatsi kingili lyolyose lya iwanu au isi, iliwatsila kuwatowa na tsisilaha hamwe na iwapinga na iwana wawo, na kutsiboka tsimali tsawo. <verse eid="EST 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 8:12" />Ichinu acho ching'atendeke mna imikowa yose ya mfalume Ahasuero, mna litsuwa lya kumi na tatu lya mwetsi ghwa kumi na mbili ighukemighwa Adari. <verse eid="EST 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 8:13" />Tsibaluwa atso ililapfighwe ka laghitso mna chila ghumkowa, tsatsighalighwa kwa chila munu mna ghumkowa, ili Wayahudi wetande kutenda aghala ka pfawabamile kutendighwa, litsuwa alyo halitsopfika. <verse eid="EST 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 8:14" />Kwa laghitso lya mfalume, watumighwa iwadinile falasi wana tsingupfu iwotsuma ng'ani, tsawatsuma. Tsibaluwa atso pfipfila tsatsilapfighwa mna ingome ya ghumji mkulu ghwa Shushani.<verse eid="EST 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 8:15" />Modekai hayalawile mna ing'anda ya mfalume, aku kapfala magwanda gha chifalume gha langi ya buluu na nzelu, lijoho tselu linoghile lya langi ya nzambalau, na litaji kulu lya nzahabu, iwanu wose wa ghumji ghwa Shushani wadeng'elela na watowa lukenze. <verse eid="EST 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 8:16" />Apfo Wayahudi wakala na ndeng'elo, ukubweda na ukutunyighwa. <verse eid="EST 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 8:17" />Mna chila mkowa na chila mji, chila hanu litangatso alyo halisomighwe, Wayahudi wadeng'elela na watenda chihungo, wabwihila, na iwanu wangi wetenda wawe Wayahudi, mana tsawawapfuka ng'ani Wayahudi.<verse eid="EST 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EST 9" />
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wowakoma maaduwi tsawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 9:1" />Tsuwa lya kumi na tatu lya mwetsi ghwa kumi na mbili, ighukemighwa Adari, halipfikile litsuwa lya ukutenda ghayalaghitse mfalume, maaduwi wa Wayahudi tsawalolela kuwahuma Wayahudi, lekeni ng'aiwile apfo baye, ila Wayahudi wawahuma wawo. <verse eid="EST 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 9:2" />Wayahudi wetingana hamwe mna imiji yawo ili mna imikowa yose ya mfalume Ahasuero kuwatowa awala wose iwabamile kuwakoma. Na kuduhu munu wowose iyadahile kwima yetowe nawo, kwaapfila iwanu wa tsiisi tsingi tsawawapfuka. <verse eid="EST 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 9:3" />Iwakulu wose wa imikowa na pfilongotsi wa maasikali na iwakulu wa mfalume pfipfila tsawawapfila Wayahudi, kwaapfila wose tsawampfuka Modekai. <verse eid="EST 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 9:4" />Modekai tsakakala munu mkulu mna ing'anda ya mfalume, na ukumanyika kwake ako tsakwenela mna imikowa yose, na ukulu wake ung'ali ukongetseka ng'ani. <verse eid="EST 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 9:5" />Apfo Wayahudi wawatowa maaduwi tsawo kwa ghamapanga, wawakoma na wawatenda ka pfawabamile, awala wose iwawehile.<verse eid="EST 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 9:6" />Ako kuna ingome ya ghumji ghwa Shushani, Wayahudi wawakoma wanu miya tano. <verse eid="EST 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 9:7" />Pfipfila wawakoma Parishandata, Dalifoni, Asipata, <verse eid="EST 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 9:8" />Porata, Adalia, Aridata, <verse eid="EST 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 9:9" />Parimashita, Arisai, Alidai, na Waizata. <verse eid="EST 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 9:10" />Awano tsa wana wamale kumi wa Hamani, iyakalile aduwi wa Wayahudi, imwana wa Hamedata. Hata apfo ng'awawabokile baye tsimali tsawo.<verse eid="EST 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 9:11" />Litsuwa lilyo mfalume kalongelighwa iwanu iwakomighwe mna ghumji ghwa Shushani. <verse eid="EST 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 9:12" />Kuya mfalume kamlongela malikiya Esta, “Mna ghumji ghwa Shushani, Wayahudi wawakoma wanu miya tano, hamwe na wana kumi wa Hamani, angu koghamba ako kuna imikowa watendiletsa! Lelo chaubama choni? Nongele chubama naghwe kutsakwing'ighwa. Nongele chinu chingi chaubama naghwe kutsotendelighwa.” <verse eid="EST 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 9:13" />Esta kalonga, “Ghwe mfalume, ung'ona pfinogha, ilupfi uwaleke Wayahudi iwali Shushani watende ka pfawatendile leloli. Kuya ulaghitse iwana kumi wa Hamani wakondekighwe mna imibiki ya ukukomela.” <verse eid="EST 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 9:14" />Naye mfalume kalaghitsa agho ghatendeke, na tangatso lilapfighwa ako Shushani. Iwana awala kumi wa Hamani wakondekighwa aku iwanu wolola. <verse eid="EST 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 9:15" />Tsuwa lya kumi na nne lya ghumwetsi ghwa Adari, Wayahudi wetingana keli, wawakoma wanu wengi kubita miya ndatu mna ghumji ghwa Shushani. Lekeni ng'awawabokile baye tsimali tsawo.<verse eid="EST 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 9:16" />Matsuwa ghagho Wayahudi iwakalile mna imikowa ya mfalume wetingana hamwe, wekinga waleke ukukomighwa. Wakombolighwa kulawa kwa maaduwi tsawo, na wawakoma maaduwi tsawo iwopfika elufu sabini na tano, lekeni ng'awawabokile baye tsimali tsawo. <verse eid="EST 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 9:17" />Tsuwa alyo tsaliwa lya kumi na kadatu lya mwetsi ghwa Adari. Tsuwa liwinzile, lya kumi na nne, wabwihila, na walitenda litsuwa alyo liwe lya chihungo na ukudeng'elela. <verse eid="EST 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 9:18" />Lekeni Wayahudi wa ghumji ghwa Shushani, pfipfila wetingana hamwe mna litsuwa lya kumi na kadatu, na lya kumi na nne, na mna litsuwa lya kumi na tano wabwihila, watenda chihungo, na wadeng'elela. <verse eid="EST 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 9:19" />Apfo Wayahudi iwokala mna ipfijiji na mna imiji midodo wobwihila mna litsuwa lya kumi na nne lya mwetsi ghwa Adari ka chihungo cha ukudeng'elela, na ukwighalila tsinzawadi.<verse eid="EST 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chihungo cha Purimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 9:20" />Modekai kaghandika aghano ghose, kuya kawaghalila tsibaluwa Wayahudi wose iwakalile mna imikowa ya mfalume Ahasuero, iwakalile habehi na iwakalile kutali. <verse eid="EST 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 9:21" />Kawalaghitsa watende chihungo chila mwaka, mna litsuwa lya kumi na nne na litsuwa lya kumi na tano lya ghumwetsi ghwa Adari, <verse eid="EST 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 9:22" />kwaapfila matsuwa aghano meli tsa matsuwa Wayahudi hawawahumile maaduwi tsawo. Mna ghamatsuwa agho, na mna ghumwetsi agho, usungu wawo ughaluka kuwa ndeng'elo, na pfililo pfawo pfighaluka pfiwa chihungo. Walaghitsighwa waghakumbuke ghamatsuwa agho kwa ukutenda chihungo, weghalile nzawadi tsa ipfijo na waweng'e ipfinu iwahingwa. <verse eid="EST 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 9:23" />Apfo Wayahudi wetogholela ukutenda ka pfawanduse, na ka Modekai pfayawandikile. <verse eid="EST 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EST 9:24" />Hamani mwana wa Hamedata iyelekighwe na Agagi, na iyakalile aduwi wa Wayahudi, tsakatenda tsengwe yawakome Wayahudi, pfipfila kasa Puri, kwa taghwa lingi yokemighwa simbi, ili yalole litsuwa lya ukuwahonda na ukuwakoma Wayahudi. <verse eid="EST 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EST 9:25" />Lekeni imbuli ayo haimpfikile mfalume, kalaghitsa kwa ukwandika ibaluwa aghala ighehile Hamani ghayabamile ghawapate Wayahudi ghampate yeye imwenyegho, na iwanaghe wakomighwe kwa ukukondekighwa mna imibiki ya ukukomela. <verse eid="EST 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EST 9:26" />Apfo waghakema ghamatsuwa agho Purimu, kulawa kuna lilonga likemighwa puri, kwa taghwa lingi simbi. Apfo kwa ibaluwa ya Modekai na aghala ghawonile iwenyegho na ighawapatile, <verse eid="EST 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EST 9:27" />Wayahudi wachitenda ichinu acho chiwe chihendo kuna wawo, na iwana wawo, na kwa munu wowose iyelunga nawo, ka mna ghamatsuwa ighasaghulighwe, chila mwaka ghamatsuwa agho meli ghadeng'elelighwe ka pfayalaghitse Modekai. <verse eid="EST 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EST 9:28" />Kuya wetogholela chila kaye ya Wayahudi, kulawa mweleko ghumwe mbaka mweleko ghungi, mna chila mkowa, na mna chila mji, wachikumbuke ichihendo acho cha Purimu, na wachideng'elele kwa matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="EST 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EST 9:29" />Baho malikiya Esta neghe Abihaili hamwe na Modekai, Myahudi, wandika tsibaluwa kwa ukulu iwali nawo, waghakomangitsa ghayandike Modekai kwa tsimbuli tsa Purimu. <verse eid="EST 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EST 9:30" />Tsibaluwa atso wandikilighwa Wayahudi wose, na tsinakala tsake tsighalighwa mna imikowa yose miya imwe na ishilini na saba ya utawala wa Ahasuero. Tsibaluwa atso tsiwabama Wayahudi wakale tseghamba. <verse eid="EST 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EST 9:31" />Pfipfila tsibaluwa atso tsiwakomangitsa wawo na iwana wawo wakumbuke ukutenda ichihungo cha Purimu mna ghamatsuwa ghake ighasaghulighwe, ka pfawang'ali woghakumbuka ghamalaghitso gha ukufunga ukuja mna ghamatsuwa gha ukudomboketsa. Ghamalaghitso aghano ghalapfighwa na Modekai, Myahudi hamwe na malikiya Esta. <verse eid="EST 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EST 9:32" />Lilaghitso lya Esta likomangitsa tsimbuli tsa Purimu, na lyandikighwa mna ichitabu.<verse eid="EST 9:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EST 10" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Modekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 10:1" />Mfalume Ahasuero kawalaghitsa iwanu iwokala muisi na iwokala mna ipfisiwa walihe kodi. <verse eid="EST 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 10:2" />Matendo makulu na ghana ingupfu ghayatendile, hamwe na imbuli yose pfayamwongetsele ukulu Modekai na kumtenda yatunyighwe ng'ani, pfose pfandikighwa mna ichitabu cha Kumbukumbu tsa wafalume wa Media na Perisia. <verse eid="EST 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 10:3" />Modekai, ayula myahudi kakala wakeli kwa ukulu kulawa mfalume Ahasuero. Katogholeka ng'ani na kuhulikitsighwa na Wayahudi, kwaapfila tsakawatendela ighanoghile iwanu wake na kuwabamila ukuka la tseghamba mweleko ghwao ghwose.<verse eid="EST 10:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 10" />
</usx>